commit fed364ff56375b434af32256df0bc97aaaa0c0bc

C03: a bare confirmation with nothing pending and a dangling alternative get their own clarification (DIALOGUE1515)

DIALOGUE1281 left «Si hazlo» (answered «¿Qué haces?») and «o en la de siempre.» (answered with a greeting) to the model. `_unresolved_input_kind` now names «bare_confirmation» (agreement to do something with no request, proposal or question pending) and «dangling_alternative» (a conjunction, preposition and article with no order verb: the tail of a sentence). `clarify_unresolved_input` composes a validated question for each: nothing is pending, what should BAXY do (never «what do you do», never a guessed action); only that part arrived, what does it refer to (no greeting, no guessed action); one corrected retry each.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


